{"4019230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GASTROVENTURE: Traditional Kitchen Diaries", "steam_appid": 4019230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a story where you’ll discover the flavors of traditional cuisine!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the streets of Istanbul, you inherit a small restaurant from your grandfather. Rediscover traditional recipes and struggle to survive in the shadow of modern fast-food chains. You won’t just be cooking meals—you’ll meet the city’s vibrant characters, share in their stories, and make the right choices to grow your restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traditional Recipes</strong>: Prepare authentic dishes and satisfy your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living City</strong>: Experience the cultural spirit of Istanbul and interact with diverse NPC characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Against Fast Food</strong>: Compete with the fast-food industry and keep your restaurant alive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Simulation</strong>: Uncover a heartfelt story while managing your culinary journey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel Opportunities</strong>: Visit different countries and cities to learn new recipes and expand your menu.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for a story where you’ll discover the flavors of traditional cuisine!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the streets of Istanbul, you inherit a small restaurant from your grandfather. Rediscover traditional recipes and struggle to survive in the shadow of modern fast-food chains. You won’t just be cooking meals—you’ll meet the city’s vibrant characters, share in their stories, and make the right choices to grow your restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traditional Recipes</strong>: Prepare authentic dishes and satisfy your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living City</strong>: Experience the cultural spirit of Istanbul and interact with diverse NPC characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Against Fast Food</strong>: Compete with the fast-food industry and keep your restaurant alive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Simulation</strong>: Uncover a heartfelt story while managing your culinary journey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel Opportunities</strong>: Visit different countries and cities to learn new recipes and expand your menu.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Get ready for a story where you’ll discover the flavors of traditional cuisine! Explore a living city, manage your restaurant, and serve your customers. Travel the world to learn new recipes and embark on your own culinary adventure!", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019230/1ead814bf15a5d11f8d8bb70c74a6687d45043af/header.jpg?t=1769557935", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019230/72c8644041da92083258965454ddf2e01621f88e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769557935", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019230/72c8644041da92083258965454ddf2e01621f88e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769557935", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> System requirements are not final and 